  "evidencia": "Page: Security Management (magazine). Sentence: Security Management is the monthly magazine of ASIS International (formerly the American Society for Industrial Security).\nPage: Computer security. Sentence: Computer security, also known as cyber security or IT security, is the protection of computer systems from the theft or damage to their hardware, software or information, as well as from disruption or misdirection of the services they provide.\nPage: Peter Tarlow. Sentence: He is the author of \"Event Risk Management and Safety,\" which was reviewed by \"Security Management\" magazine in 2003 and 2005.",
