        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: ASIS International, American Society for Industrial Security\n- Publications: Security Management\n- Concepts: Computer security, cyber security, IT security\n- People: Peter Tarlow\n- Works: Event Risk Management and Safety\n\nFacts:\n- Security Management is the monthly magazine of ASIS International, which was formerly called the American Society for Industrial Security.\n- Computer security, also called cyber security or IT security, is the protection of computer systems from theft or damage to hardware, software, or information and from disruption or misdirection of their services.\n- In 2003 and 2005, Security Management reviewed Peter Tarlow's book Event Risk Management and Safety.",
